WEBVTT

00:00:04.505 --> 00:00:07.341
Nice! That looks great on you!

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.094
I'm sure everyone will be
shocked when they see

00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:13.555
just how fashionable
you are, Kageyama-kun!

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:16.558
Nii-san... Are you gonna
go out wearing that?

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.770
You'll let me borrow it sometime?

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:22.648
Er, I'm fine, thanks...

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:25.984
Huh? What the hell is that shirt?

00:00:26.193 --> 00:00:27.444
Why did you take off your jacket?

00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:30.989
Keep it on. Your school jacket
has higher defense points.

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:32.783
I think I might finally be popular.

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.661
Your time's finally arrived...

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.413
That's not a misunderstanding.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.249
You've got the wrong idea.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:43.001
You better realize that
before you get hurt.

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:46.797
What the...? No, really. What the eff?

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.632
What the hell is that design?!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.759
Why were you wearing that
under your uniform?

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:53.554
It's so lame that I'm starting
to worry about you.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.847
Just looking at it makes me uneasy.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.016
Hey, is something really bothering you?

00:00:58.225 --> 00:01:00.394
Are you just not thinking?

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:04.189
Did you happen to get that
on sale for dirt cheap?

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:08.735
Or are you wearing it because
you actually thought it was cool?

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:11.029
Are you okay?

00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:13.115
You have such shit tast--

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:16.910
His energy is growing...

00:01:17.119 --> 00:01:19.037
Is he gonna attack me?!

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:31.842
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:36.930
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:40.475
I realized that my youth was grey

00:01:40.684 --> 00:01:43.437
The root of this irritation is unknown

00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:45.939
My brain runs parallel with this emotional train

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:49.151
Struggling adolescence

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:51.987
Don't disturb the subconscious mind

00:01:52.195 --> 00:01:54.823
Who's that behind me?

00:01:55.032 --> 00:01:58.452
Opposing ideas, distortion

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:02.080
Purge the sorrow

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:05.626
So, do what you can now.

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.753
My life

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:08.795
Finally

00:02:09.004 --> 00:02:13.050
Break it down!!

00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:15.969
(WANT) desire (YOUNG) and sincerity

00:02:16.178 --> 00:02:18.764
(BURN) they begin to sprout (1) within my chest

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.558
(TRANCE) I won't awaken (CHANCE) but I want to

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:24.519
(STANCE) both sides of the coin
(1) are back-to-back

00:02:24.728 --> 00:02:27.314
Accept me as I am

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:30.525
Conflicting freedom and relations

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.694
If they can become one

00:02:32.903 --> 00:02:34.321
That smile will be

00:02:34.529 --> 00:02:36.156
One and only "1"

00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:41.745
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:41.953
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:42.954
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:42.954 --> 00:02:43.163
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.623
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
One and only "1"

00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:44.831
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.751
"Mob Psycho 100 "
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:47.751 --> 00:02:48.585
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:48.794 --> 00:02:51.713
One and only "1"

00:02:53.048 --> 00:02:57.552
"Divine Tree 3
- Dimple Is~"

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.561
This light...

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.147
Is it the power of Psycho Helmet-sama?

00:03:09.356 --> 00:03:12.776
What's happening inside the Divine Tree?

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:14.653
It's so pretty...

00:03:20.951 --> 00:03:25.997
Whew, I panicked for a sec.
I thought he was finally gonna blow.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:30.961
What's wrong all of a sudden?
Are you that shocked?

00:03:31.169 --> 00:03:34.715
Did you actually like that lame shirt?

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:37.467
Oh, now he's attacking.

00:03:37.676 --> 00:03:39.886
Godly Barrier!

00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:42.889
What the--?

00:03:43.098 --> 00:03:45.976
He got blown away easier
than I thought he would.

00:03:46.184 --> 00:03:47.811
No, really. What's wrong?

00:03:49.688 --> 00:03:52.190
I don't feel any power from Shigeo.

00:03:52.399 --> 00:03:55.569
He's totally empty and defenseless.

00:03:55.777 --> 00:03:58.697
Did the Divine Tree suck his energy dry?

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:06.413
No. A moment ago, Shigeo was
releasing energy like a popped balloon.

00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:11.543
Hey. Did you use up the rest of your energy?

00:04:11.752 --> 00:04:15.338
On purpose? But why?

00:04:15.547 --> 00:04:17.549
Did you lose all hope in me?

00:04:17.758 --> 00:04:20.177
You don't feel like getting
through to me anymore?

00:04:20.385 --> 00:04:22.763
You're going to let this end half-assed?

00:04:22.971 --> 00:04:26.516
I even went through the trouble
of transforming into God Dimple.

00:04:26.725 --> 00:04:28.977
Hey! Hello?

00:04:29.186 --> 00:04:32.397
You sleeping, Shigeo?
What are you trying to do?

00:04:32.606 --> 00:04:35.609
I thought you didn't want
to accept what I'm doing!

00:04:35.817 --> 00:04:38.361
Now that I have godly powers,

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.656
how the hell are you gonna fight me
without your psychic powers?

00:04:48.914 --> 00:04:52.334
Standing before you is a powerful enemy
unlike any you've faced before.

00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:55.962
At this rate, it's all going to be over
with a little prick from my finger!

00:04:56.171 --> 00:04:57.005
Hello?!

00:04:57.214 --> 00:05:01.092
You're right. But you
won't actually do that.

00:05:01.301 --> 00:05:02.761
I understand now.

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:07.098
When I talk to you, having powers
is just going to get in the way.

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:10.560
Now, we can finally talk.

00:05:14.272 --> 00:05:16.066
See?

00:05:16.274 --> 00:05:19.444
I knew I could trust you, Dimple.

00:05:19.653 --> 00:05:20.862
Huh?

00:05:20.862 --> 00:05:21.154
"Trust"
Huh?

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:21.363
"Trust"

00:05:21.363 --> 00:05:22.864
"Trust"
Trust?

00:05:22.864 --> 00:05:22.948
Trust?

00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:24.908
Trust...?

00:05:25.116 --> 00:05:27.035
Why?

00:05:27.244 --> 00:05:31.498
Because you gave me your honest
opinion about this shirt.

00:05:32.457 --> 00:05:34.251
Dimple, you're just Dimple.

00:05:34.459 --> 00:05:37.504
Wait, wait, wait.
None of this makes sense.

00:05:37.712 --> 00:05:40.382
You don't like how I'm doing things, right?

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.552
You okay with leaving me like this?

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:47.973
I'm... a dangerous evil spirit!

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:50.308
You're not dangerous, Dimple.

00:05:50.517 --> 00:05:51.518
I figured it out.

00:05:51.726 --> 00:05:53.186
Huh?

00:05:53.395 --> 00:05:55.814
You just got carried away.

00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:58.608
I think everyone goes through
something like that.

00:06:00.235 --> 00:06:02.904
Master Reigen mentioned that, too.

00:06:03.113 --> 00:06:04.406
That's not true.

00:06:04.614 --> 00:06:08.743
This confidence that I have is backed up
with a bunch of hard work.

00:06:08.952 --> 00:06:13.415
Don't compare me with some randos
that just get carried away.

00:06:13.623 --> 00:06:16.459
I got carried away, too.

00:06:16.668 --> 00:06:18.086
So... I get it.

00:06:18.295 --> 00:06:22.215
Huh? Er, no, you're actually
way too modest, usually...

00:06:22.424 --> 00:06:24.050
No.

00:06:24.259 --> 00:06:26.720
I really did get carried away.

00:06:26.928 --> 00:06:28.388
I'm sorry.

00:06:29.431 --> 00:06:31.766
What do you mean, "sorry"?

00:06:31.975 --> 00:06:36.605
You're not trying to win me over now
with this half-assed attempt, are you?

00:06:36.813 --> 00:06:42.027
Back then, I'd gotten carried away
and didn't listen to what you had to say.

00:06:42.235 --> 00:06:44.195
Why don't you give
your schemes a rest already?

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.867
We should've talked
everything out back then.

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:51.912
But I was so worried about
if I was popular or not

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:55.582
that I lost sight of what was
way more important.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.126
I'm sorry, Dimple.

00:06:58.335 --> 00:07:01.838
When it felt like you could finally do
what you always wanted to do,

00:07:02.047 --> 00:07:04.674
finally get what you always longed for...

00:07:04.883 --> 00:07:07.761
...you invited me.

00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:11.264
You clearly could've
pulled this off on your own,

00:07:11.473 --> 00:07:14.184
but you still invited me to join you.

00:07:14.392 --> 00:07:18.146
And that... was the most important part.

00:07:18.355 --> 00:07:20.357
This wasn't some scheme.

00:07:20.565 --> 00:07:23.777
You just wanted to do what
you've always wanted to do...

00:07:23.985 --> 00:07:26.237
...with me.

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:31.826
You trusted me before I ever trusted you.

00:07:32.035 --> 00:07:33.536
So thank you.

00:07:33.745 --> 00:07:36.039
Hey, stop that.

00:07:36.247 --> 00:07:39.709
Don't you go making up how I feel.

00:07:39.918 --> 00:07:44.047
It's so gross that I'm starting
to get goosebumps.

00:07:44.255 --> 00:07:46.424
Something felt off.

00:07:46.633 --> 00:07:50.637
Something just didn't feel right.

00:07:50.845 --> 00:07:55.767
I finally got all of these followers,
and I pretty much had no obstacles.

00:07:55.976 --> 00:07:58.687
I could finally have a world
where I'm at the center.

00:07:58.895 --> 00:08:02.941
I basically became a god,
just like I planned...

00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:05.610
...but somehow, it's no fun at all.

00:08:06.528 --> 00:08:09.406
There's so much I just couldn't
understand with this guy.

00:08:09.614 --> 00:08:12.993
Like why he didn't use his
psychic powers in his everyday life.

00:08:13.201 --> 00:08:16.579
Or why he never went along
with my awesome ideas...

00:08:16.788 --> 00:08:20.458
The fact that he could never
fully commit really annoyed me, too.

00:08:20.667 --> 00:08:25.296
The only thing was... His desire to
make the girl he likes notice him...

00:08:25.505 --> 00:08:29.884
I felt like that was something
I could somewhat relate to.

00:08:31.136 --> 00:08:35.015
I want people to acknowledge me.
To know I exist.

00:08:35.932 --> 00:08:40.812
After what happened with (LOL),
he noticed me, even though I was a ghost.

00:08:41.021 --> 00:08:43.690
He didn't fear me. He didn't shun me.

00:08:43.898 --> 00:08:46.735
In the end, he accepted me.

00:08:46.943 --> 00:08:50.196
Back then, I thought I could use this guy...

00:08:50.405 --> 00:08:56.286
But besides that, I felt something tensed up
in my heart slowly start to unravel.

00:08:56.494 --> 00:09:02.083
Being with Shigeo, who has such little desire,
made me lose sight of my goal, too?

00:09:02.292 --> 00:09:05.170
Wait, no. That's BS!

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:08.173
I'm going to lose my reason for being!

00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:10.842
No, things are just getting started!

00:09:11.051 --> 00:09:15.680
I... still have so much that
I want to do! I have ambitions!

00:09:15.889 --> 00:09:18.641
Yeah, I know...

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:22.228
I'll hear you out.
About everything you want to do...

00:09:22.437 --> 00:09:24.355
...as your friend.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:36.117
Yeah... God and followers don't matter.

00:09:36.326 --> 00:09:40.872
I never realized this until now,
but all I ever wanted...

00:09:41.081 --> 00:09:43.541
...was a friend.

00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:48.922
Shigeo... You're truly amazing.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.383
Yeah, I'm done.

00:09:52.592 --> 00:09:54.803
I'm going to stop messing
with everyone's minds.

00:09:55.011 --> 00:09:59.349
I'm going to erase all memories
of the fake Psycho Helmet I created.

00:09:59.557 --> 00:10:01.601
Then everyone will return to normal.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.145
If the source of what's feeding
that worship energy disappears,

00:10:04.354 --> 00:10:07.690
my godly powers will go away.

00:10:07.899 --> 00:10:10.860
I'll return to normal as well.

00:10:11.069 --> 00:10:12.362
Are you sure you're okay with this?

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:13.571
Wha--?!

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.574
Wasn't becoming a god your dream?

00:10:16.783 --> 00:10:22.038
I'm giving that up because you kept coming
at me with "this is probably bad" logic!

00:10:22.247 --> 00:10:25.250
I see. You're right.

00:10:34.676 --> 00:10:35.677
Let's go home.

00:10:35.885 --> 00:10:37.178
Yeah.

00:10:39.764 --> 00:10:41.975
H-Hey, what's wrong, Shigeo?

00:10:42.183 --> 00:10:44.686
It looks like I exerted too much power...

00:10:44.894 --> 00:10:48.064
Well, of course this would happen, then!

00:10:48.273 --> 00:10:53.736
Damn it... Why are you so awkward?

00:10:53.945 --> 00:10:55.738
Fine.

00:10:55.947 --> 00:10:57.240
Here.

00:11:07.834 --> 00:11:14.090
You were basically like this every day when
you first joined the Body Improvement Club.

00:11:14.299 --> 00:11:17.844
How long are you going to look like that?

00:11:18.052 --> 00:11:23.641
It'll probably take about a week for me
to naturally lose my godly powers.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:28.438
Actually, could you come back to my place
in about a week, then?

00:11:28.646 --> 00:11:31.983
You sure don't hold back
sometimes, kid.

00:11:32.192 --> 00:11:37.155
Oh, yeah. We need to do something
about this broccoli.

00:11:37.363 --> 00:11:40.241
So how were you planning to get rid of it?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:42.994
Lift it up with my telekinesis
and drop it into the ocean.

00:11:43.203 --> 00:11:46.289
Huh? There's no way you could possibly...

00:11:46.497 --> 00:11:50.668
Actually, the reason you terrify me is because
I can't finish that sentence with conviction.

00:11:52.754 --> 00:11:55.048
This is such a fine broccoli.

00:11:55.256 --> 00:11:58.259
It could've been an amazing tourist spot.

00:11:58.468 --> 00:12:02.096
I feel a little bad,
but we don't have much choice.

00:12:02.305 --> 00:12:07.143
People tend to get enamored by
anything mystical or overwhelming.

00:12:07.352 --> 00:12:11.981
This broccoli will probably be in
the back of people's minds for a while.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.610
I'm starting...

00:12:17.695 --> 00:12:20.156
...to get really sleepy.

00:12:20.365 --> 00:12:22.617
Can you wake me up when we get back home?

00:12:22.825 --> 00:12:27.288
I ain't your servant, damn it!
Who the hell do you think I am?

00:12:28.665 --> 00:12:29.582
Tch.

00:12:29.791 --> 00:12:32.377
Don't you dare drool on me.

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.504
I did say, "Let's go home,"

00:12:34.712 --> 00:12:38.216
but the truth is, I don't actually
have anywhere to go home to.

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:42.053
Now I've lost my goal, too.
I wonder what I should do.

00:12:43.471 --> 00:12:44.847
Hey.

00:12:50.478 --> 00:12:51.896
What?

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.698
Psycho Helmet...

00:13:01.906 --> 00:13:05.285
But I'm not controlling
the Divine Tree anymore.

00:13:05.493 --> 00:13:09.163
Wh-Who the hell are you?

00:13:09.372 --> 00:13:12.834
Wait... I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:16.004 --> 00:13:19.507
The Divine Tree basically sucked up
my feelings along with all of the believers'

00:13:19.716 --> 00:13:22.010
and has now gained consciousness.

00:13:22.218 --> 00:13:26.139
If it's already gained a personality
called Psycho Helmet

00:13:26.347 --> 00:13:30.518
and was patiently waiting to steal the authority
over this incredible amount of energy

00:13:30.727 --> 00:13:33.313
that's lost control...

00:13:41.029 --> 00:13:42.447
Leave that...

00:13:42.655 --> 00:13:44.615
...behind.

00:13:44.824 --> 00:13:46.034
He's sustenance.

00:13:46.242 --> 00:13:47.702
Shigeo! Wake up right now!

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.912
We've got some real trouble on our hands!

00:13:52.582 --> 00:13:54.542
Seriously?!

00:13:54.751 --> 00:13:55.793
Wake up, Shigeo!

00:13:56.002 --> 00:13:58.379
Now's really not the time to be sleeping!

00:13:58.588 --> 00:14:00.673
It's no use... He won't wake up.

00:14:09.265 --> 00:14:11.392
Godly Beam!

00:14:25.073 --> 00:14:30.912
You bastards! Give Shigeo back, damn it!

00:14:40.505 --> 00:14:42.131
Wait right here.

00:14:49.347 --> 00:14:54.727
Hand him over... Hand him over...
Hand him over...

00:15:12.745 --> 00:15:14.497
Hand him over.

00:15:18.668 --> 00:15:20.253
Hup!

00:15:45.361 --> 00:15:46.737
What the...?

00:15:48.489 --> 00:15:51.993
Hand him over... Hand him over...

00:15:56.372 --> 00:15:58.749
It's sucking up...

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:00.960
...all of my powers?!

00:16:07.758 --> 00:16:11.179
Godly Beam!

00:16:50.968 --> 00:16:54.680
Hand him over...

00:18:07.628 --> 00:18:09.922
Hey, you're awake.

00:18:10.131 --> 00:18:12.133
Can you move now?

00:18:12.341 --> 00:18:17.513
Not yet... I can't move at all.
I can't really see, either.

00:18:17.722 --> 00:18:18.973
Understood.

00:18:19.181 --> 00:18:23.019
I think I heard something really loud.
Did something happen?

00:18:23.227 --> 00:18:26.147
Nah, nothing. You probably dreamt it.

00:18:26.355 --> 00:18:28.774
We're still not home yet?

00:18:28.983 --> 00:18:31.152
Not yet. I took a little break.

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.529
I'm pretty exhausted myself.

00:18:33.738 --> 00:18:35.615
I see...

00:18:35.823 --> 00:18:41.537
Shigeo, this is the first time I've ever used
such an enormous amount of power.

00:18:41.746 --> 00:18:48.169
You basically lived your life
holding in all this psychic power.

00:18:48.377 --> 00:18:53.382
I think I finally understand
just how amazing that is.

00:18:53.591 --> 00:18:58.512
Getting carried away because you were getting
noticed by girls is adorable in comparison.

00:18:58.721 --> 00:19:02.558
It's only natural to get carried away
when you have this much power.

00:19:02.767 --> 00:19:05.770
It's only natural to let this power
go to your head...

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:08.773
And yet, you...

00:19:11.233 --> 00:19:15.237
You're a man. You're gonna be big.

00:19:15.446 --> 00:19:19.450
My brainwashing would actually
work on Shigeo right now.

00:19:19.659 --> 00:19:24.121
Listen carefully. These are
my first and final orders to you.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:27.625
First, wake up. Stand up, Shigeo.

00:19:29.835 --> 00:19:33.464
I don't have any strength left in my legs.
My arms won't move, either.

00:19:33.673 --> 00:19:37.760
I know your body's wrecked, but stand up.

00:19:37.968 --> 00:19:41.263
Even if you can't stand,
you need to do it.

00:19:41.472 --> 00:19:45.059
And you need to walk
with your own two feet.

